# zj-agent-mob: prompts answered without asking.
# One `allow <tool> [arg-prefix]` per line. Allow-only by design: a wrong
# auto-deny wedges a turn, where a wrong auto-allow stays bounded by whatever
# the agent's own sandbox already permits.
#
# The prefix is matched literally, so it is NOT word-bounded on its own:
# `allow Bash git` would also match `gitleaks`. The trailing space is what
# pins it to the git command itself.
allow Read
allow Bash git 
